# Product visual truth-lock byte store (runtime-written cutouts/sources, keyed by
# product-digest). These are large per-product artifacts regenerated by the visual
# pipeline; the DB is the audit record, not these loose files. Ignoring them keeps
# `git clean -fd` and branch switches from wiping the LIVE runtime store — the root
# cause of the recurring "cutout hilang bila update" data loss. See
# docs/incident-truth-lock-byte-store-desync.md. The tracked demo fixture product
# (data/exact-product/MWCB_25ML_CAP_BURUNG/) is committed and unaffected.
data/exact-product/product-*/
data/exact-product-cutouts/

# Local tooling / debug artifacts (machine-specific; do not commit)
.mcp.json
.playwright-mcp/

